# A local Overpass on the host (podman, image wiktorn/overpass-api, Ukraine extract) can go first: the fetcher tries the
# endpoints in order, so the public ones stay as a fallback. Data outside Ukraine is empty there. It needs a host firewall
# rule for the VMs, see README, "Local Overpass".
#OVERPASS_URLS=http://192.168.50.1:12345/api/interpreter,https://overpass-api.de/api/interpreter
OVERPASS_URLS=https://overpass-api.de/api/interpreter,https://overpass.private.coffee/api/interpreter,https://overpass.kumi.systems/api/interpreter
PORT=8080
